        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Poha serves 4 and takes about 25 minutes. Rinse the flattened rice gently and drain it well so it softens but does not turn mushy. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tempering",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tadka"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of mustard seeds starts the dish."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rinse the flattened rice in a colander and leave it to drain, do not soak it."
          }
        ]
      },
