        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Poha is the breakfast of central and western India. It is light, quick and easy on the stomach. The peanuts add crunch and the lime adds zing. Serve it warm with tea. It is a gentle start to the day."
          }
        ]
      }
